    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8379ee92b100c370",
      "translationZh": "[项目] OntoPrune：在本地 CPU 上通过 Ollama 实现 6.7 倍更快的 TTFT，利用神经符号上下文剪枝（节省 83-86% 的 token + 0% 幻觉）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af13c94e736ab01d",
      "translationZh": "仓库：https://github.com/vigmarcarlo/OntoPrune 许可证：MIT",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fad3ce386028116f",
      "translationZh": "如果您在商品硬件（如仅 CPU 的笔记本电脑或搭配 Ollama 的迷你 PC）上运行小型编码模型（Qwen 2.5 Coder 1.5B/3B、Gemma 2B、DeepSeek Coder），您就会知道提示评估瓶颈。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a10e4c54b395cb1",
      "translationZh": "将 300 行服务文件喂入 CPU 上的 3B 模型仅生成第一个 token（TTFT）就花费了 22.4 秒。此外，当给予过多噪声上下文时，较小的模型经常会虚构不存在的方法。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "891d84c79f4075be",
      "translationZh": "我构建了 OntoPrune 来解决这个问题。它是一个轻量级的、100% 离线的 Python 中间件，充当符号上下文编译器：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fd47342c36f8bf0e",
      "translationZh": "使用内部本体将源代码翻译为内存中的知识图。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3567c4e8ed39dc4e",
      "translationZh": "通过 SPARQL 提取您正在编辑的函数的确切 1-hop 闭包（仅包括它实际交互的类、函数和接口）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f5cd05d0a327ca0",
      "translationZh": "将修剪后的图渲染回干净的、带类型的 Python 存根（约 400 个 token，而非 2,400+ 个）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d67e99a68e1269bf",
      "translationZh": "验证模型生成的代码与合约 AST 是否匹配，以捕获任何 API 幻觉。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e078c7ab2a9d887f",
      "translationZh": "在本地 CPU（12 核，Ollama 流式）上的基准测试：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1e46cfea0cee2dd",
      "translationZh": "模型：qwen2.5-coder:3b",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0af947a3cf33fb4f",
      "translationZh": "输入 token：2,390 -> 406 token（-83.0%）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "969f6993fe7b520a",
      "translationZh": "TTFT（首 token 时间）：22.4s -> 3.3s（快 6.7倍，节省 19.1 秒！）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e45f5ea61e43ec10",
      "translationZh": "总生成时间：59.9s -> 16.5s（-72.5%）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d313cda5088c5d9",
      "translationZh": "幻觉：完整文件上下文幻觉出现 1 次不存在的方法调用；OntoPrune 有 0 次无效调用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f498180b45e09a1",
      "translationZh": "OntoPrune 的 CPU 开销：AST 解析 + RDF 图生成 + SPARQL 查询总共耗时 9.9 ms。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5725fe1657ea1cb5",
      "translationZh": "还在 Gemini 3.8 Flash (Cloud) 上进行了测试：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ad104a9424ec831",
      "translationZh": "2,815 tokens -> 393 tokens（-86.0% 成本降低）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d13a7c17801c08c8",
      "translationZh": "零 RDF 暴露：您和您的 LLM 仅与普通的 Python 签名和存根进行交互。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e1bb25b8ade029a",
      "translationZh": "模型上下文协议（MCP）：随附 ontoprune-mcp，因此您可以在 Cursor、Claude Desktop、Antigravity 或任何代理中使用它。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "833b8632cc097418",
      "translationZh": "多模块解析：跟随项目在文件间的导入，不会因循环依赖而卡住。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ba01893ca79b678",
      "translationZh": "合同验证：在 CI/CD 或 CLI 管道中确定性地标记幻觉 API。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46c6b41a1a167de4",
      "translationZh": "论文和可重现的代码均在 GitHub 上开源：https://github.com/vigmarcarlo/OntoPrune",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bedb99b4fc147385",
      "translationZh": "欢迎反馈、PR 以及在不同硬件上的基准测试运行！超级欢迎",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
